    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i live in an apartment in berlin and the radiator in my bedroom isn't working at all. its freezing in here. can you help me write a formal letter to my Hausverwaltung (the property management) to report this and tell them they need to fix it urgently? i need it to sound professional and serious so they actually take it seriously.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "[Your Name]\n[Your Apartment Number and Address]\nBerlin, Germany\n[Date]\n\nHausverwaltung\n[Apartment Management Company Name]\n[Company Address]\nBerlin, Germany\n\nDear Property Management,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to bring to your immediate attention a pressing issue regarding the radiator in my apartment at [Apartment Number]. Unfortunately, it appears that the radiator is not functioning properly, leaving my bedroom extremely cold and creating an uncomfortably frigid environment.\n\nGiven the current temperatures outside, this problem requires urgent resolution. A warm and habitable living space is fundamental, and I kindly request that your maintenance team inspect and repair the radiator at the earliest convenience. Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter; I look forward to a swift resolution.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Full Name]\n[Your Contact Information]",
